ake identity she is using  to evade the world government the  mystery of bonnie and her true  intentions get even more interesting  during the reverie even though she is  supposed to be on the run from the world  government bonnie decides to infiltrate  marijuana by posing as the elderly queen  dowager of the sorbet kingdom the sorbet  kingdom is one of the participants in  the reverie and it was once ruled by  bartholomew kuma who as we all know  ended up joining the revolutionaries at  least he did it first although he later  decided to become a warlord and  eventually he became a cyborg thanks to  dr vegapunk we don't know why kuma left  the revolutionaries and it's extremely  likely that he was forced to do it  through some sort of blackmail  after bonnie manages to sneak into the  so-called domain of the gods she sees  rosward abusing cyborg kuma who has now  become a slave for rent  this site seems to really affect and  upset bonnie which might indicate that  she has some sort of connection to kuma  and by extension to the revolutionaries  and if bonnie is in fact connected to  the revolutionaries then she could have  met dragon and conceived luffy with him  again provided that she is actually a  lot older than she pretends to be other  aspects of bonnie's behavior that appear  to hint that something like this is  possible is the fact that she actually  cried during ace's execution she also  praised luffy-in-law's actions and said  she was proud to be a member of the same  generation as them and of course she  went out of her way to stop zorro from  hitting charles at sabaodi and if she  hadn't done that then zoro and the whole  archipelago would have faced massive  retaliation from the world government i  mean none of these things prove that she  is luffy's mother not even close but  they do contribute to it being a  possibility and if luffy's mother does  turn out to be someone we've already met  in the story i do think that it will be  bonnie after all her 