utionary army that is trying to  bring down the entire world government  so assuming that luffy's mom is a  celestial dragon who had an affair with  monkey d dragon i guess we would call  that ship dragon x dragon or double  dragon and assuming that luffy's mother  is indeed still alive then where is she  now why haven't we seen her in the story  either with luffy or with dragon or with  anyone else for the answer to these  questions we have to remember who the  celestial dragons are and how they view  other people they claim to possess the  blood of this world's creators and they  see themselves as gods compared to other  people they believe themselves to be  inherently superior to everyone else and  even the kings and nobles of powerful  kingdoms that are part of the world  government are seen as mere playthings  by the celestial dragons a single  celestial dragon has immense power the  admirals are under their direct command  and an attack of any kind on a single  world noble could lead to the  destruction of an entire kingdom  ironically these same facts provide the  explanation for both how luffy's parents  might have been able to maintain a  forbidden relationship and what could  have happened to luffy's mother after  luffy was born as i said even a single  celestial dragon has a lot of power and  influence so it is possible that luffy's  mom could have used that power to  maintain a secret relationship with  dragon there are some small hints that  something like this could have been  going on for years for instance dragon  was present at goldie rogers execution  and if you pause the anime at just the  right time you can just barely make out  what appears to be a celestial dragon in  the crowd the fact that this person is  standing among the crowd suggests that  they were there in an unofficial  capacity now to me this looks like a  male celestial dragon although it's hard  to make out the person's facial features  but even if this is a guy this world  noble c