stial dragon had a child with  someone who is not only a commoner but  also a member of the dreaded d clan on  top of that the world nobles would have  almost certainly wanted to get rid of  baby luffy permanently but it seems that  garp somehow managed to protect him  after the love of his life was  imprisoned dragon escalated his  revolutionary activities against the  world government his motivations are not  only justice and fairness his  motivations are also personal because he  wants to rescue luffy's mother from her  captivity and this is why dragon became  known as the world's worst criminal many  criminals and pirates have directly  threatened the world government over the  years but only the man who dared to have  a child with a celestial dragon deserves  the title of the very worst criminal  this is the secret that dragon has been  keeping from everyone including his own  revolutionary comrades the secret that  he fell in love with a celestial dragon  and that he is driven in part by the  desire to rescue her also it would be  pretty poetic if luffy ended up being  the one who takes down the celestial  dragons and the world government that  would prove that the d-clan really are  the natural enemies of the celestial  dragons because a single celestial  dragon's decision to have a child with a  member of the d-clan brought about the  destruction of all of them all of this  is highly speculative of course because  when it comes to luffy's mother  speculation is really all we have that  said the jewelry bonnie theory that i  mentioned earlier could actually be  somewhat combined with this theory if  bonnie is hiding her true age and if the  reason why the world government is after  her is the fact that she is a celestial  dragon who went rogue then bonnie could  be dragon's forbidden love the only  difference would be that after she was  imprisoned for having luffy she actually  managed to escape her captivity i'm not  saying this is likely but as i mentioned