ne other major character present at  god valley we're just not aware of it  yet we know that garp always wanted his  son and grandson to follow in his  footsteps and to become marines  so what if a young dragon was actually  there with garp at the time of the god  valley incident dragon would have been  about 17 years old back then and he may  have been a new recruit or a marine in  training under the direct supervision of  his father garp in their capacity as  marines garp and dragon would have been  tasked with rescuing the celestial  dragons before zebek got to them dragon  may have taken part in the rescue  operation which would help explain why  garp fought so hard to protect the  celestial dragons even though he hates  them and why he was willing to work  together with roger even though he hates  pirates if dragon was present on the  island then his safety would also depend  on defeating zebic so garp did what he  had to do not just to protect the world  nobles but also to protect his own son  now if dragon was on god valley then he  likely would have had direct contact  with the celestial dragons as part of  the rescue operation and what if one of  those celestial dragons was a young  woman around the same age as dragon they  could have met there and established a  relationship that would last for many  years to come it's possible that they  ran away together right then and there  causing dragon to abandon his career as  a marine or they could have parted ways  at god valley but found some way of  staying in touch and meeting in secret  luffy was born 19 years after the god  valley incident so if luffy's brother is  a world noble who met dragon on that day  then she must have spent nearly two  decades in a relationship with him  perhaps it was a long-distance  relationship or perhaps they actually  ran away together but either way luffy  would eventually be born luffy's mother  would disappear without a trace and  dragon would become the commander of a  revolutionary army that is trying to  bring down the entire world government  so assuming that luffy's mom is a  celestial dragon who had an affair with  monkey d dragon i guess we would call  that ship dragon x dragon or double  dragon and assuming that luffy's mother  is indeed still alive then where is she  now why haven't we seen her in the story  either with luffy or with dragon or with  anyone else for the answer to these  questions we have to remember who the  celestial dragons are and how they view  other people they claim to possess the  blood of this world's creators and they  see themselves as gods compared to other  people they believe themselves to be  inherently superior to everyone else and  even the kings and nobles of powerful  kingdoms that are part of the world  government are seen as mere playthings  by the celestial dragons a single  celestial dragon has immense power the  admirals are under their direct command  and an attack of any kind on a single  world noble could lead to the  destruction of an entire kingdom  ironically these same facts provide the  explanation for both how luffy's parents  might have been able to maintain a  forbidden relationship and what could  have happened to luffy's mother after  luffy was born as i said even a single  celestial dragon has a lot of power and  influence so it is possible that luffy's  mom could have used that power to  maintain a secret relationship with  dragon there are some small hints that  something like this could have been  going on for years for instance dragon  was present at goldie rogers execution  and if you pause the anime at just the  right time you can just barely make out  what appears to be a celestial dragon in  the crowd the fact that this person is  standing among the crowd suggests that  they were there in an unofficial  capacity now to me this looks like a  male celestial dragon although it's hard  to make out the person's facial features  but even if this is a guy this world  noble could have been sent here by  luffy's mother in order to send a  message to dragon or receive a message  from him or both and yes i do realize  that this is a huge stretch but i just  found it so interesting that a celestial  dragon seems to be there at the  execution and yet you really have to go  out of your way to spot it anyway there  is a big difference between a celestial  dragon carrying on a forbidden affair  with someone and the celestial dragon  actually having a child with someone who  is not a world noble not to mention that  dragon is a member of the d clan who are  the natural enemies of the world nobles  don't forget that the world nobles are  descendants of only 19 families and that  they view their blood as sacred and pure  it goes without saying that a celestial  dragon having a child with someone who  is not a world noble would be strictly  forbidden a world noble having a child  with monkey d dragon would not only lead  to that individual woman facing social  pressure  it would actually be a lot more serious  than that a world noble having a child  with someone like dragon would challenge  the entire world noble system it would  challenge the very notion that celestial  dragons are gods who are superior to  other people and so the world nobles  would go to any length to erase all  evidence of something like that  happening if luffy's mother is a  celestial dragon the reason we've never  seen her is because she was likely  imprisoned in marijua as soon as the  truth about her son came out using her  power as a world noble she may have been  able to find ways of seeing dragon  before this and she may have even been  plotting to change the corrupt system of  the world nobles along with dragon but  as soon as a child was brought into the  picture there would be no more lenience  she would have been stripped of all of  her rights and freedoms and permanently  imprisoned somewhere deep within marijua  so that she could never reveal the fact  that a celestial dragon had a child with  someone who is not only a commoner but  also a member of the dreaded d clan on  top of that the world nobles would have  almost certainly wanted to get rid of  baby luffy permanently but it seems that  garp somehow managed to protect him  after the love of his life was  imprisoned dragon escalated his  revolutionary activities against the  world government his motivations are not  only justice and fairness his  motivations are also personal because he  wants to rescue luffy's mother from her  captivity and this is why dragon became  known as the world's worst criminal many  criminals and pirates have directly  threatened the world government over the  years but only the man who dared to have  a child with a celestial dragon deserves  the title of the very worst criminal  this is the secret that dragon has been  keeping from everyone including his own  revolutionary comrades the secret that  he fell in love with a celestial dragon  and that he is driven in part by the  desire to rescue her also it would be  pretty poetic if luffy ended up being  the one who takes down the celestial  dragons and the world government that  would prove that the d-clan really are  the natural enemies of the celestial  dragons because a single celestial  dragon's decision to have a child with a  member of the d-clan brought about the  destruction of all of them all of this  is highly speculative of course because  when it comes to luffy's mother  speculation is really all we have that  said the jewelry bonnie theory that i  mentioned earlier could actually be  somewhat combined with this theory if  bonnie is hiding her true age and if the  reason why the world government is after  her is the fact that she is a celestial  dragon who went rogue then bonnie could  be dragon's forbidden love the only  difference would be that after she was  imprisoned for having luffy she actually  managed to escape her captivity i'm not  saying this is likely but as i mentioned  earlier luffy and bonnie do have similar  energy let me know what you guys think  who is luffy's mother is she someone  we've already met in the story or is she  yet to be introduced is she dead or is  she still alive is she an important  person like a celestial dragon or is she  just a regular woman definitely leave  your thoughts down in the comments below  i always love hearing from you if you  guys enjoyed this video and you want to  see more in the future don't forget to  leave a like and comment it only takes a  second but it really helps with that  youtube algorithm and remember that  subscribing and hitting that bell is a  completely free but important way of  directly supporting the channel you can  also hit me up on twitter and instagram  at animeopror as always thank you guys  so much for watching and until next time  see ya space cowboys
 

